Package: praxocore
Type: Package
Title: Embeddable AI Agent Framework for R
Version: 0.12.0
Authors@R: person("AxisVela", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "releases@axisvela.com")
Description: Native R Core for PRAXO-CORE, an embeddable MIT-licensed agent
    framework. Provides an in-process agent loop with tool calls, JSON Schema
    subset, plugin manifests, memory, events, checkpoint envelopes, policy,
    context, and middleware. It is not an HTTP user agent, crawler, hosted
    service, or model provider.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/axisvela/praxo-core, https://axisvela.github.io/praxo-core/
BugReports: https://github.com/axisvela/praxo-core/issues
NeedsCompilation: no
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
